COMMON MISTAKES - QUICK TABLE

================================================================================

Mistake                 | Avoid                        | Better
------------------------|------------------------------|--------------------------
Modify prop             | props.count = 5              | Read props.count
Increment received prop | props.count++                | Call callback prop
Mutate state array      | books.push(book)             | setBooks([...books, book])
Heavy props drilling    | Pass through many layers     | Consider Context when needed
Unclear callback        | onClick={fn}                 | onDelete={handleDelete}


