DATA vs CALLBACK - QUICK REVISION

================================================================================

Data Prop                    | Callback Prop
-----------------------------|----------------------------------
Parent → Child               | Parent → Child
Contains a value/object      | Contains a function
Child reads it               | Child calls it
Example: count={count}       | onIncrement={increment}
Represents current data      | Represents requested action


