PROPS vs STATE - QUICK REVISION

================================================================================

Props                         | State
------------------------------|-----------------------------------
Passed into component         | Owned by a component
Read-only for receiver        | Updated through state setter
Come from parent/source       | Created/managed by state owner
Used to configure component   | Represents changing local/shared data


