================================================================================

Remember:

DATA GOES DOWN
EVENTS/CALLBACK REQUESTS GO UP


More precisely:

PARENT OWNS
     ↓
PROPS FLOW DOWN
     ↓
CHILD READS
     ↓
CHILD CALLS CALLBACK
     ↓
PARENT UPDATES
     ↓
NEW PROPS FLOW DOWN


Or:

STATE → PROPS → CHILD → EVENT → CALLBACK → STATE


